Subject: Cantor Phase3 Topology Acquisition Lineage Forms Source

Description: Raw selected build source for strict pure machine forms that represent acquisition claims, complete lineage, causal acquisition roles, common scope, current carrier and reconciliation bindings, evidence derivation claims, and typed faults before any Windows scanner implementation. This source is not canonical authority and grants no code, platform, filesystem, acquisition, clock, issuer, consumer, fixture, or effect authority until complete SJS and an exact implementation signature.

& [SourceIdentity] is exact
  + [source_snapshot_uuid] is 6fffb113-5add-4910-970a-08ad7b82f0ec
