  + at most one new safe-Rust pure module and one export
  + exact existing serde and error dependencies only
  + no Cargo.toml or Cargo.lock change
  + no unsafe
  + no platform-specific cfg required except static absence checks
  + no filesystem, handle, pointer, clock, process, environment, random, network, persistence, Git runtime, model, tool, or effect
  + production implementation remains forbidden until full SJS selects exact types and construction boundary

& [Compatibility] is additive and non-migrating
  + no live acquisition forms, scanner producer, receipt issuer, ledger, or external consumer exists
  + current forms and carrier profiles remain unchanged
  + new profile 0.1 is exact and independent
  + no compatibility decoder or migration is required
  + future profile changes are strict and separately sourced

